WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.834
-Yesterday, Politico
published a draft opinion

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:06.434
that revealed the Supreme Court
has decided to overturn

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.934
the landmark case
Roe versus Wade

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.267
and end abortion rights.

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.267
Many of us
are disheartened by this

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.100
and are struggling to understand
what can be done to protect

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.601
women's reproductive freedom.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.300
To help us out, please welcome
two representatives

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.901
from the Democratic
National Committee.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.367
-Thank you, Seth Meyers.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:26.667
Now, America, we understand
things are looking down.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.267
-For a lot of us,
the future seems dim.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:31.901
-But we, the Democratic
National Committee,

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:35.200
are here to reassure you
that we will get through this.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.868
-We have a plan.

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:39.334
Democrats are going to show up
in record numbers

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:42.901
this upcoming election
and vote, vote, vote.

00:00:42.901 --> 00:00:45.701
-Oh, wow. I mean, that really
makes me breathe easier.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:48.234
So you really think we have
a chance of stopping this?

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:49.534
-[Bleep] no!

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.901
-What the [bleep]
are you talking about?!

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:53.467
-I thought you said
you had a plan!

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.934
-We don't have a plan!
-We're Democrats!

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:58.734
We can barely tie
our own [bleep] shoes!

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.734
-This guy thinks we have a plan.
-A plan.

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.267
-But we need you to,
I don't know,

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.234
maybe provide
some guidance here.

00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:07.701
-Okay. Okay. You're right.
It's not over.

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:09.534
We hold the majority
in Congress.

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:12.834
We can pass legislation
that will keep abortion legal.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.434
-Yes. There's still hope.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.000
-See? That's what
I'm talking about.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.133
So you really think
there's still hope?

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.367
-[Bleep] no!

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.033
-Can you even hear yourself?!

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:22.634
-You sound insane right now!

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.434
-The legislative branch?!

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:26.434
Have you heard of Joe Manchin?!

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:27.968
We can't get anything
through there!

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.400
-But you said!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.934
-"Buh-buh-buh-buh but you said!"
Listen to this idiot!

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:33.167
-We're Democrats!

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.033
We couldn't find something
to write with

00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:36.701
in a pencil factory!

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:39.968
-Okay, so this situation
is completely hopeless.

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:41.234
-[ Both whispering ]

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.934
-Okay. Okay. Maybe not.

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:44.834
There's always
the judicial branch.

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:46.968
-That's right.
We can fight this in court

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:48.834
and take it all the way
to the Supreme Court

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:51.734
and get them to reinstate
Roe v. Wade.

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:54.734
-Wait a minute. Isn't the
Supreme Court the problem?

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.601
-You're damn right it is!

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:59.901
There's like 17 conservatives
on the Supreme Court!

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:02.167
-There's only
supposed to be 9 justices,

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:05.033
but somehow they got like
17 conservatives on there!

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.567
And, like,
30 of them are Catholic!

00:02:07.567 --> 00:02:09.334
And 20 of them
are super Catholic!

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:11.133
-Oh, my God! We're [bleep]!

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:13.200
-We're so [bleep]!
-Oh, my God!

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.701
We are totally
and completely useless!

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:17.968
-Okay, come on.
There's got to be something!

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:20.100
-Yes. You're right.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.167
Everyone take out your phone
and text "We're [bleep]"

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:25.334
to 02024

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:27.167
and throw your phone
out the window!

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:29.868
-No! Something real!

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:31.033
-[ Groans ]

00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.200
-[ Both whispering ]

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.033
-Okay. Okay. You know what?

00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:36.167
There's still
the executive branch.

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:39.601
We can get Joe Biden
to issue an executive order.

00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:42.167
-Okay. That's a great idea.
He'll do that, right?

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:43.734
-[bleep] no!

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.200
-That guy can't do anything!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.167
He can't forgive three dollars
in student loans!

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:51.133
-The guy can't even maintain
the back of his haircut!

00:02:51.133 --> 00:02:53.968
He's losing the fight
against his own mullet!

00:02:53.968 --> 00:02:56.767
But you think he's gonna win
the fight for abortion rights?!

00:02:56.767 --> 00:02:57.968
-Alright, alright. Look.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.634
You guys,
you can't give up, okay?

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:01.434
I mean, it's easy
to blame Democrats

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:03.033
for being ineffective,
but it's important to remember

00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:05.467
that this is the result

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:07.567
of a decades-long plan
by Republicans.

00:03:07.567 --> 00:03:09.667
And, sure, maybe Democrats
haven't been as effective

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.100
as we've wanted them to be,

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.467
but when your backs
are to the wall,

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:17.434
I know you have what it takes
to get this done.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:18.934
-You do?

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:19.934
-Well...

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.667
-I knew it! We're [bleep]!

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.167
-We're totally [bleep]!

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.601
-Two representatives from

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:26.801
the Democratic National
Committee, everybody.

00:03:26.801 --> 00:03:30.100
Why are you being proud?
Why are you posing?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.133
Stop posing!

